{"books": [{"id": "7habit", "title": "七个习惯", "author": "史蒂芬·柯维", "shelf": "导读", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/7habit/", "accent": "#1b4332", "blurb": "按原书顺序，先讲清每一站，再用五步重讲一遍。"}, {"id": "ruiprincipal", "title": "原则", "author": "瑞·达利欧", "shelf": "导读", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/ruiprincipal/", "accent": "#1a3654", "blurb": "从疼里写出的生活原则和工作原则，每一站读两遍。"}, {"id": "ep", "title": "进化心理学", "author": "戴维·巴斯", "shelf": "导读", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/ep/", "accent": "#1c3d36", "blurb": "心理当初在解决什么问题。解释不是许可。"}, {"id": "sunzi", "title": "孙子兵法", "author": "孙武", "shelf": "经文卡片", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/sunzi/", "accent": "#6b3a2a", "blurb": "十三篇读书卡：原文、句读、白话、名家对比与背诵。"}, {"id": "zhouyi", "title": "周易", "author": "经文", "shelf": "经文卡片", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/", "accent": "#5c4a32", "blurb": "六十四卦读书卡。用来学习，不是占卜。"}, {"id": "lijiu", "title": "历久", "author": "跨书索引", "shelf": "索引", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/lijiu/", "accent": "#7a3048", "blurb": "三十五条扛住了时间的原则，每条都写明失效边界。"}], "entries": [{"book": "7habit", "title": "整张地图", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/7habit/", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "7habit", "title": "由内而外", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/7habit/foundation/", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "7habit", "title": "一条成长的路", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/7habit/path/", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "7habit", "title": "积极主动", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/7habit/habit-1/", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "7habit", "title": "以终为始", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/7habit/habit-2/", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "7habit", "title": "要事第一", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/7habit/habit-3/", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "7habit", "title": "双赢思维", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/7habit/habit-4/", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "7habit", "title": "知彼解己", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/7habit/habit-5/", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "7habit", "title": "统合综效", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/7habit/habit-6/", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "7habit", "title": "不断更新", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/7habit/habit-7/", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "7habit", "title": "收束", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/7habit/together/", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "ruiprincipal", "title": "整张地图", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/ruiprincipal/", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "ruiprincipal", "title": "从哪里来", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/ruiprincipal/origin/", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "ruiprincipal", "title": "拥抱现实", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/ruiprincipal/reality/", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "ruiprincipal", "title": "五步流程", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/ruiprincipal/five-steps/", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "ruiprincipal", "title": "极度开放", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/ruiprincipal/open-mind/", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "ruiprincipal", "title": "了解差异", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/ruiprincipal/wired/", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "ruiprincipal", "title": "做决定", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/ruiprincipal/decide/", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "ruiprincipal", "title": "求真透明", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/ruiprincipal/culture/", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "ruiprincipal", "title": "可信度加权", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/ruiprincipal/weight/", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "ruiprincipal", "title": "选对人", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/ruiprincipal/people/", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "ruiprincipal", "title": "操作机器", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/ruiprincipal/machine/", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "ruiprincipal", "title": "写成自己的", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/ruiprincipal/together/", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "ep", "title": "整张地图", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/ep/", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "ep", "title": "心理的地基", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/ep/foundation/", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "ep", "title": "活下来", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/ep/survival/", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "ep", "title": "女性长期", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/ep/women/", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "ep", "title": "男性长期", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/ep/men/", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "ep", "title": "短期", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/ep/short-term/", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "ep", "title": "抚育", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/ep/parenting/", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "ep", "title": "亲属", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/ep/kinship/", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "ep", "title": "合作", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/ep/cooperate/", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "ep", "title": "攻击", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/ep/aggression/", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "ep", "title": "冲突", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/ep/conflict/", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "ep", "title": "地位", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/ep/status/", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "ep", "title": "收成一门科学", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/ep/together/", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "sunzi", "title": "始计", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/sunzi/#chapter/1", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "sunzi", "title": "作战", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/sunzi/#chapter/2", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "sunzi", "title": "谋攻", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/sunzi/#chapter/3", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "sunzi", "title": "军形", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/sunzi/#chapter/4", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "sunzi", "title": "兵势", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/sunzi/#chapter/5", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "sunzi", "title": "虚实", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/sunzi/#chapter/6", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "sunzi", "title": "军争", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/sunzi/#chapter/7", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "sunzi", "title": "九变", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/sunzi/#chapter/8", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "sunzi", "title": "行军", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/sunzi/#chapter/9", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "sunzi", "title": "地形", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/sunzi/#chapter/10", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "sunzi", "title": "九地", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/sunzi/#chapter/11", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "sunzi", "title": "火攻", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/sunzi/#chapter/12", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "sunzi", "title": "用间", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/sunzi/#chapter/13", "blurb": ""}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "乾", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/1", "blurb": "像天一样刚健，持续进取，但要懂进退时位。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "坤", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/2", "blurb": "像大地一样包容承载，柔顺而有原则。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "屯", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/3", "blurb": "万事开头难，宜建根基，不宜硬闯。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "蒙", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/4", "blurb": "山下出泉，蒙昧待启；教与学要真诚、守正。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "需", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/5", "blurb": "云在天上，该等雨；有诚信，才能安然度过险阻。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "讼", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/6", "blurb": "天与水违行，争执易起；宜见大人调解，不宜硬闯。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "师", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/7", "blurb": "众如水聚于地，兴师必须纪律与贤将。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "比", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/8", "blurb": "水在地上，亲附互助；后来无诚者凶。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "小畜", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/9", "blurb": "风行天上，小有积蓄；力量未足，暂难成大雨。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "履", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/10", "blurb": "踩在虎尾上仍能亨通——礼与谨慎让危险可变通途。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "泰", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/11", "blurb": "地在上天在下（气交），通泰安和，仍要防盛极而转。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "否", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/12", "blurb": "天向上地向下，不交则否；小人得势时，君子守正待倾否。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "同人", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/13", "blurb": "与人和同要像原野一样开阔，不可只认小圈子。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "大有", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/14", "blurb": "大有收获时，用诚信与威严并济，并感念天助。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "谦", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/15", "blurb": "山在地中，高而能下；六十四卦中谦卦最通泰。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "豫", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/16", "blurb": "雷出地奋，欢乐鼓舞；乐要正，豫要豫（预备）。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "随", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/17", "blurb": "此动彼悦，彼此跟随；跟对人、跟对时才无咎。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "蛊", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/18", "blurb": "山下有风，积弊生蛊；整治腐败，先甲后甲要有计划。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "临", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/19", "blurb": "地临于泽，上位者亲临；八月有凶，盛后须防衰。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "观", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/20", "blurb": "风行地上，遍观万物；先自观其生，再观国之光。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "噬嗑", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/21", "blurb": "口中有物须咬合；刑罚用以去间隔、恢复畅通。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "贲", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/22", "blurb": "山下有火，文采焕然；装饰要适度，白贲才是最高。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "剥", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/23", "blurb": "山附于地，阴剥阳；不利有攸往，守住硕果。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "复", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/24", "blurb": "雷在地中，阳气初回；迷途知返，七日来复。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "无妄", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/25", "blurb": "天下雷行，万物各正；不妄为则吉，不正则有眚。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "大畜", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/26", "blurb": "天在山中，大积蓄；止健以养贤，不家食而吉。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "颐", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/27", "blurb": "上止下动如嘴嚼食；养生养德，看你求的是什么。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "大过", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/28", "blurb": "泽灭木，栋梁弯曲；非常时期要非常行动，过犹不及须辨。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "坎", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/29", "blurb": "水再水流，险上加险；以诚信维心，行险而不失其信。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "离", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/30", "blurb": "明两作离，火必须附着；利贞如畜牝牛，柔顺中正才吉。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "咸", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/31", "blurb": "山上有泽，少男少女相感；感应要正，取女吉。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "恒", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/32", "blurb": "雷风相与，恒久之道；不恒其德则或承之羞。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "遁", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/33", "blurb": "天下有山，阴长阳退；君子适时退避，嘉遁贞吉。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "大壮", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/34", "blurb": "雷在天上，阳气大壮；利贞，用罔（网/不用蛮力）勿用壮。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "晋", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/35", "blurb": "日出地上，前进光明；康侯受宠，但戒鼫鼠式的投机。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "明夷", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/36", "blurb": "光明受伤入地；艰难中守正，如箕子晦藏其明。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "家人", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/37", "blurb": "风自火出，家风由内生；利女贞，闲有家。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "睽", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/38", "blurb": "二女同居志不同行；对立中仍可小事吉，终遇雨则合。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "蹇", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/39", "blurb": "山上有水，跋蹇难行；往蹇来誉，利见大人。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "解", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/40", "blurb": "雷雨作而百果甲拆；险难缓解，宜早往，宜解小人。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "损", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/41", "blurb": "山下有泽，减损有时；有孚则可，二簋可用享。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "益", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/42", "blurb": "风雷相益，上给下；迁善改过，利涉大川。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "夬", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/43", "blurb": "泽上于天，五阳决一阴；扬于王庭，不利即戎。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "姤", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/44", "blurb": "天下有风，一阴遇五阳；女壮勿取，遇之不等于纵之。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "萃", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/45", "blurb": "泽上于地，会聚；王假有庙，用大牲，聚要有诚信。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "升", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/46", "blurb": "地中生木，上升有时；南征吉，勿恤，用见大人。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "困", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/47", "blurb": "泽无水，困穷；大人吉，有言不信，仍须守贞。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "井", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/48", "blurb": "木上有水，井；改邑不改井，修好井让人喝到水。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "革", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/49", "blurb": "泽中有火，变革；时机成熟才取信，大人虎变。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "鼎", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/50", "blurb": "木上有火，鼎；去故取新，正位凝命。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "震", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/51", "blurb": "洊雷震，接连打雷；怕过后笑言哑哑，不丧匕鬯。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "艮", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/52", "blurb": "兼山艮，止其所；背对诱惑，行庭不见人，无咎。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "渐", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/53", "blurb": "山上有木，渐长；女归吉，鸿雁逐步高飞。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "归妹", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/54", "blurb": "泽上有雷，少女归；位不当则征凶，提醒关系要合礼合时。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "丰", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/55", "blurb": "雷电皆至，丰盛；勿忧宜日中，盛极须防蔀暗。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "旅", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/56", "blurb": "山上有火，旅行在外；小亨旅贞吉，琐碎与骄都招灾。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "巽", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/57", "blurb": "随风出入，巽入；申命行事，柔而能入，利见大人。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "兑", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/58", "blurb": "丽泽兑，两泽相连；亨利于正，君子以朋友讲习。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "涣", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/59", "blurb": "风行水上，涣散；王假有庙，散中求凝聚，利涉大川。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "节", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/60", "blurb": "泽上有水，节制；苦节不可贞，甘节吉。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "中孚", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/61", "blurb": "泽上有风，中孚；豚鱼吉，诚信感及微物，利涉大川。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "小过", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/62", "blurb": "山上有雷，小有过越；可小事不可大事，宜下不宜上。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "既济", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/63", "blurb": "水在火上，已成既济；事成更要戒慎，初吉终乱。"}, {"book": "zhouyi", "title": "未济", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/zhouyi-reading-cards/#gua/64", "blurb": "火在水上，尚未渡过；小狐汔济濡尾，提醒差最后一步最险，而世界永远「未完成」。"}, {"book": "lijiu", "title": "分清可控与不可控", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/lijiu/#dichotomy-of-control", "blurb": "把精力全部投向你能决定的那部分，对不能决定的部分保持坦然——这是几乎所有情绪管理方法的共同祖先。"}, {"book": "lijiu", "title": "知道自己不知道", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/lijiu/#know-what-you-dont-know", "blurb": "「我不知道」是一个合法答案，也是唯一开著的那扇门；难的不是说出它，是先发现自己该说它。"}, {"book": "lijiu", "title": "兼听则明，偏信则暗", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/lijiu/#listen-to-both-sides", "blurb": "顺耳的信息会自己找上门，逆耳的不会。所以兼听不是一种态度，是一笔你得先付的钱。"}, {"book": "lijiu", "title": "反过来想", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/lijiu/#invert", "blurb": "别问「怎样才能赢」，先问「怎样一定会出局」——然后不去那里。赢法千奇百怪，死法总是那几种。"}, {"book": "lijiu", "title": "如无必要，勿增实体", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/lijiu/#occams-razor", "blurb": "同一组事实，两个解释都说得通，选假设更少的那个。不是因为简单更可能对，而是因为简单更容易被抓住——肯露出脖子的解释，才经得起刀。"}, {"book": "lijiu", "title": "看激励，而不是看承诺", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/lijiu/#incentives", "blurb": "想知道一个人或一个组织会怎么做，别问他信什么。去查他做对了拿到什么，做错了赔掉什么，以及他赔不掉的那部分由谁来赔。承诺告诉你他想被怎样看见；激励告诉你，他最后会往哪里走。"}, {"book": "lijiu", "title": "己所不欲，勿施于人", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/lijiu/#golden-rule", "blurb": "把「我不愿被这样对待」当作行为下限——这是被最多互不相干的文明各自独立写下来的一条规则。"}, {"book": "lijiu", "title": "认识你自己", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/lijiu/#know-thyself", "blurb": "你对自己的判断往往是所有判断里最不准的一个，而它却是其他所有判断的基础。"}, {"book": "lijiu", "title": "慎独", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/lijiu/#integrity-alone", "blurb": "没有人看见的时候你怎么做，才是你真正的标准；被看见时的表现只是表演。"}, {"book": "lijiu", "title": "德行是练出来的，不是想出来的", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/lijiu/#virtue-is-habit", "blurb": "你不是先成为某种人再去做那些事，而是先反复做那些事，然后成为那种人。"}, {"book": "lijiu", "title": "满招损，谦受益", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/lijiu/#humility-gains", "blurb": "顺境时的自我膨胀，是绝大多数由盛转衰的起点——不是运气变了，是人变了。"}, {"book": "lijiu", "title": "知足不辱，知止不殆", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/lijiu/#know-when-enough", "blurb": "知道「够了」在哪里，是一种能力；没有这条线的人，赢多少次都会在最后一次全部还回去。"}, {"book": "lijiu", "title": "礼尚往来", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/lijiu/#reciprocity", "blurb": "关系是靠来回流动维持的；只进不出或只出不进的关系，都会在沉默中结束。"}, {"book": "lijiu", "title": "信誉是唯一会复利的社会资产", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/lijiu/#reputation-compounds", "blurb": "建立要很多年、很多次，摧毁只要一次；正因为不对称，它才值钱。"}, {"book": "lijiu", "title": "先求理解，再求被理解", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/lijiu/#seek-first-to-understand", "blurb": "多数争执并不是观点之争，而是两个人都在等对方先听懂自己。"}, {"book": "lijiu", "title": "能用无心解释的，别归因于恶意", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/lijiu/#hanlons-razor", "blurb": "大多数伤害你的行为，起因是疏忽、压力或者信息不对称，而不是有人在针对你。"}, {"book": "lijiu", "title": "你会成为你身边人的平均值", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/lijiu/#choose-company", "blurb": "环境的塑造力被严重低估——你长期共处的人决定了你觉得什么是正常的。"}, {"book": "lijiu", "title": "复利：小优势 × 长时间", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/lijiu/#compounding", "blurb": "微小但持续的改进，在足够长的时间里会拉开无法追赶的差距——难点从来不是幅度，是持续。"}, {"book": "lijiu", "title": "你只拥有现在", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/lijiu/#now-is-all-you-have", "blurb": "时间不是不够用，是被漏掉的——大部分被消耗在了追悔过去和排练未来上。"}, {"book": "lijiu", "title": "先迈出第一步，别等想清楚全部", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/lijiu/#start-small", "blurb": "行动会产生信息，而信息才让计划变得可行；停在原地想，只会得到越来越精致的想象。"}, {"book": "lijiu", "title": "抓主要矛盾", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/lijiu/#vital-few", "blurb": "少数原因决定了大部分结果；找出那一小撮，剩下的可以容忍粗糙。"}, {"book": "lijiu", "title": "做难而正确的事", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/lijiu/#do-hard-things", "blurb": "价值通常藏在别人不愿承受的那部分不适里；一件事如果既容易又高回报，它不会等到你。"}, {"book": "lijiu", "title": "先活下来，再谈别的", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/lijiu/#survive-first", "blurb": "任何一次归零，都会让此前所有的正确归零；避免出局的优先级高于提高收益。"}, {"book": "lijiu", "title": "不要把鸡蛋放在一个篮子里", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/lijiu/#diversify", "blurb": "分散不能提高你的上限，但能保证你在判断失误时不会被一次性淘汰。"}, {"book": "lijiu", "title": "居安思危", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/lijiu/#prepare-in-peace", "blurb": "准备的窗口期恰恰是你觉得不需要准备的时候；等到需要时，窗口已经关了。"}, {"book": "lijiu", "title": "把可逆和不可逆的决策分开对待", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/lijiu/#irreversible-first", "blurb": "可逆的事快做，错了就改；不可逆的事慢做，因为没有下一次。"}, {"book": "lijiu", "title": "已经付出的，不该影响接下来的选择", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/lijiu/#sunk-cost", "blurb": "决策只看未来的收益和成本；过去投入了多少，在数学上与该不该继续无关。"}, {"book": "lijiu", "title": "一切都会变，包括现在这个状态", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/lijiu/#impermanence", "blurb": "变化不是意外，是默认设置；痛苦大多来自把某个暂时状态当成了永久。"}, {"book": "lijiu", "title": "困扰你的是你的解释，不是事件本身", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/lijiu/#judgment-not-events", "blurb": "同一件事发生在不同人身上后果天差地别，差异发生在解释这一步——而解释是可以训练的。"}, {"book": "lijiu", "title": "塞翁失马：短期判断经常是错的", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/lijiu/#blessing-in-disguise", "blurb": "在事件刚发生时给它盖章定性「好」或「坏」，是我们最常犯也最少察觉的错误。"}, {"book": "lijiu", "title": "苦难本身无意义，但人可以赋予它意义", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/lijiu/#meaning-in-suffering", "blurb": "无法改变处境时，仍然可以选择用什么态度面对它——这是最后一项无法被剥夺的自由。"}, {"book": "lijiu", "title": "记住你会死", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/lijiu/#memento-mori", "blurb": "有限性不是生命的缺陷，而是让选择变得有分量的那个前提。"}, {"book": "lijiu", "title": "决定一生幸福的，主要是关系的质量", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/lijiu/#relationships-are-the-answer", "blurb": "不是收入、成就或名声，而是你有没有几个可以真正依靠的人。"}, {"book": "lijiu", "title": "过犹不及", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/lijiu/#golden-mean", "blurb": "几乎所有美德都是两个极端之间的那个位置，而这个位置随情境移动，需要判断力而不是公式。"}, {"book": "lijiu", "title": "给予是最反直觉的获得方式", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/lijiu/#give-more", "blurb": "长期看，持续为他人创造价值的人得到的最多；这不是道德劝诫，而是网络的结构性结果。"}], "links": {"https://brianbai1123.github.io/7habit/habit-1/": [{"book": "历久", "title": "分清可控与不可控", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/lijiu/#dichotomy-of-control"}, {"book": "原则", "title": "拥抱现实", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/ruiprincipal/reality/"}], "https://brianbai1123.github.io/7habit/habit-3/": [{"book": "历久", "title": "抓主要矛盾", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/lijiu/#vital-few"}, {"book": "孙子", "title": "始计", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/sunzi/#chapter/1"}, {"book": "原则", "title": "五步流程", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/ruiprincipal/five-steps/"}, {"book": "孙子兵法", "title": "始计", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/sunzi/#chapter/1"}], "https://brianbai1123.github.io/7habit/habit-5/": [{"book": "历久", "title": "先求理解，再求被理解", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/lijiu/#seek-first-to-understand"}, {"book": "原则", "title": "极度开放", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/ruiprincipal/open-mind/"}, {"book": "孙子兵法", "title": "谋攻", "href": "https://brianbai1123.github.io/sunzi/#chapter/3"}], "https://brianbai1123.github.io/7habit/habit-4/": [{"book": "历久", "title": "己所不欲，勿施于人", "href": "htt